      "PORTUGUESE": "Você tá bem?",
      "SPANISH": "¿Estás bien?",
      "PERSIAN": "حالت خوبه؟؟"
    }
  },
  {
    "INDEX": 3.0,
    "TIME": {
      "SHOW": 4.0,
      "HIDE": 5.4
    },
    "SCRIPT": {
      "KOREAN": "제가 잡아줬어야 됐는데.",
      "ENGLISH": "I should’ve caught you…",
      "CHINESE_SIMPLIFIED": "我应该及时扶住你的...",
      "CHINESE_TRADITIONAL": "我應該要抓住你的",
      "JAPANESE": "俺が支えてあげればよかったのに",
      "INDONESIAN": "Harusnya tadi aku nangkep kamu…",
      "PORTUGUESE": "Devia ter te segurado.",
      "SPANISH": "Debí haberte atrapado.",
      "PERSIAN": "باید می گرفتمت…"
    }
  },
  {
    "INDEX": 4.0,
    "TIME": {
      "SHOW": 6.0,
      "HIDE": 6.8
    },
    "SCRIPT": {
      "KOREAN": "유나 씨.",
      "ENGLISH": "Yu-na…",
      "CHINESE_SIMPLIFIED": "有娜小姐",
      "CHINESE_TRADITIONAL": "有娜小姐",
      "JAPANESE": "ユナさん",
      "INDONESIAN": "Yu-na…",
      "PORTUGUESE": "Yuna...",
      "SPANISH": "Yuna...",
      "PERSIAN": "یونا…"
    }
  },
  {
    "INDEX": 5.0,
    "TIME": {
      "SHOW": 7.2,
      "HIDE": 10.0
    },
    "SCRIPT": {
      "KOREAN": "윽..창피하니깐 그만 좀 물어보죠?",
      "ENGLISH": "Ugh… can we not talk about it? It’s embarrassing.",
      "CHINESE_SIMPLIFIED": "呃...别一直问啦，好丢脸！",
      "CHINESE_TRADITIONAL": "嗚...太丟臉了，你先別問了好嗎？",
      "JAPANESE": "うっ…恥ずかしいからもう聞かないでくださいね？",
      "INDONESIAN": "Ugh… bisa nggak sih jangan dibahas? Malu tau…",
      "PORTUGUESE": "Pode parar de falar disso? Que vergonha.",
      "SPANISH": "¿Puedes dejar de hablar de eso? Es vergonozoso.",
      "PERSIAN": "اوه ... نمی توانیم در مورد اون صحبت کنیم؟ خجالت آور است"
    }
  },
  {
    "INDEX": 6.0,
    "TIME": {
      "SHOW": 10.9,
      "HIDE": 12.0
    },
    "SCRIPT": {
      "KOREAN": "내가 일으켜 줄게요",
      "ENGLISH": "Here, I’ll help you up.",
      "CHINESE_SIMPLIFIED": "我扶你起来吧",
      "CHINESE_TRADITIONAL": "那我扶你起來吧",
      "JAPANESE": "俺が起こしますね",
      "INDONESIAN": "Sini, aku bantu berdiri.",
      "PORTUGUESE": "Deixa eu te ajudar.",
      "SPANISH": "Déjame ayudarte.",
      "PERSIAN": "در اینجا، من به شما کمک می کنم تا بالا بیایید."
    }
  },
  {
    "INDEX": 7.0,
    "TIME": {
      "SHOW": 12.7,
      "HIDE": 15.4
    },
    "SCRIPT": {
      "KOREAN": "아니, 그 뒤로 좀 돌아줘요.",
      "ENGLISH": "No—just… turn around for a sec.",
      "CHINESE_SIMPLIFIED": "不用，你转过去就好",
      "CHINESE_TRADITIONAL": "不用...麻煩你轉過去",
      "JAPANESE": "いや、後ろ向いててください",
      "INDONESIAN": "Nggak—cuma… tolong balik badan dulu.",
      "PORTUGUESE": "Não, só vira pra lá um pouquinho.",
      "SPANISH": "No, solo voltéate un rato.",
      "PERSIAN": "نه - فقط... برای یک ثانیه بچرخید."
    }
  },
  {
    "INDEX": 8.0,
    "TIME": {
      "SHOW": 15.8,
      "HIDE": 16.9
    },
    "SCRIPT": {
      "KOREAN": "나 혼자서 일어나게 ",
      "ENGLISH": "I’ll get up on my own.",
      "CHINESE_SIMPLIFIED": "我自己能起来",
      "CHINESE_TRADITIONAL": "讓我一個人站起來",
      "JAPANESE": "自分で起きますから",
      "INDONESIAN": "Aku bisa bangun sendiri.",
      "PORTUGUESE": "Eu consigo me levantar sozinha.",
      "SPANISH": "Puedo levantarme sola.",
      "PERSIAN": "من خودم بلند میشم"
    }
  },
  {
